

Forrit minnisstjórnun: 1.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['']. }.
>> p := Satt.
>> a := Listi ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.
>> c := Hlutur nýtt.
c við: ['greet:'] gera: { Úttak skrifa: ['greet!']. }.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.
>> usedMemory5 := 0.

Forrit taka-til.
>> usedMemory1 := (Forrit minni ? 0).




